# Guard: DO NOT CHECK IN ANYTHING BUT TEST KEYS.
# Ignore everything in keys/ by default, then re-include only the known stock TEST cert config
# and this folder's docs. Production/proprietary keys are supplied at build time and must never
# be tracked here.
*

# re-include docs + guard
!.gitignore
!README.md

# re-include ONLY the stock Qualcomm test cert config (SecTools Test User)
!qti_presigned_certs-key2048_exp257_hashSHA384/
!qti_presigned_certs-key2048_exp257_hashSHA384/**

# re-include the particle_image_v1 manifest-signing keys. The public key is needed
# everywhere to verify; the .key is a THROWAWAY TEST signing key only (sign-profile=test).
# Production manifest keys are supplied at build time via secret/mount and never tracked.
!particle-ota-pub.pem
!particle-ota-test-ed25519.key
